 tried in federal court all  convicted all housed in the Federal  Bureau of Prisons not a single security  incident because the US taxpayer about  four hundred and fifty million dollars a  year to keep Gitmo open in 16 years  despite seven active prosecutions there  have been no convictions by these  military tribunals brett jennifer  griffin live at the pentagon Jennifer  thanks
 

